---
// Chamada para seguir o Instagram do site, no fim dos artigos.
import { site } from '../data/site';
const ig = site.social.instagram;
---
<aside class="siga" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="40" height="40" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2.2c3.2 0 3.6 0 4.8.1 3.3.1 4.8 1.7 4.9 4.9.1 1.3.1 1.6.1 4.8s0 3.6-.1 4.8c-.1 3.2-1.7 4.8-4.9 4.9-1.3.1-1.6.1-4.8.1s-3.6 0-4.8-.1c-3.3-.1-4.8-1.7-4.9-4.9C2.2 15.6 2.2 15.2 2.2 12s0-3.6.1-4.8C2.4 3.9 3.9 2.4 7.2 2.3 8.4 2.2 8.8 2.2 12 2.2Zm0 4.6a5.2 5.2 0 1 0 0 10.4 5.2 5.2 0 0 0 0-10.4Zm0 8.6a3.4 3.4 0 1 1 0-6.8 3.4 3.4 0 0 1 0 6.8Zm5.4-9.9a1.2 1.2 0 1 0 0 2.4 1.2 1.2 0 0 0 0-2.4Z"/></svg>
  <p><strong>Dicas rápidas todo dia no Instagram.</strong> Comparativos, medidas e truques para economizar energia, em poucos segundos. Siga <a href={ig.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{ig.usuario}</a>.</p>
</aside>

<style>
  .siga { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; margin: 2rem 0; padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf2f8, #eef6ff); border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  .siga svg { flex: none; color: #d62976; }
  .siga p { margin: 0; }
  .siga a { font-weight: 800; }
</style>
